This feels very real.  Can relate to it as a normal part of someone''s day.  Love the grain / B&amp;W choice here.  Although I''m a bit shocked that ISO 800 produced THIS much grain for you.  Did you have a secret setting (not questioning, really want to know), like maybe underexposing a couple stops or something?  I have a gazillion settings on my Sony cameras but not sure I have one for enhanced grain.  Now I need to go check.  :-D</td>', 'This feels very real.  Can relate to it as a normal part of someone''s day.  Love the grain / B&W choice here.  Although I''m a bit shocked that ISO 800 produced THIS much grain for you.  Did you have a secret setting (not questioning, really want to know), like maybe underexposing a couple stops or something?  I have a gazillion settings on my Sony cameras but not sure I have one for enhanced grain.  Now I need to go check.  :-D', '2024-06-10 06:38:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(7766963, 1288446, 2158, '<td valign="top">
